              "This program is specifically crafted for seasoned professionals looking to advance their careers and expand their sectoral knowledge. It is intended for individuals with substantial industry experience."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "What is the minimum system configuration required?",
            "content": [
              "## Minimum System Requirements for the Program:",
              "- **Processor**: Any modern processor – Intel Core i3 (10th Gen or newer) / AMD Ryzen 3 (3000 series or newer) / Apple M1 or later",
              "- **RAM:** 4GB (8GB recommended for better performance)"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Time Commitment",
        "content": [
          {
            "title": "How much time does one need to spend on a regular basis?",
            "content": [
              "Ideally, 30 minutes of preparation time is recommended each day, but students can allocate time according to their own schedules. They can choose to practice, read, or watch videos. Additionally, students must attend live classes on weekends. The schedule for these classes will be shared in advance."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "What is the duration of the program?",
            "content": ["The duration of the program is 11 months."]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Why XLRI",
        "content": [
          {
            "title": "How's the General Management program different?",
            "content": [
